@startuml
title VRL Debugger — state and ownership
skinparam shadowing false

class DebugSession {
  expressions : tuple[VrlExpression]
  _input_event : original JSON
  index : int
  _states : dict[int, DebugState]
  _trace_history : list[state, node]
  _trace_requests : list[enter, finish]
  _checkpoint_cache : dict[key, snapshot]
  line_breakpoints : dict[line, target, condition]
  edits : list[dict]
  watches : list[path]
}
class DebugState {
  index : int
  event : JSON
  locals : dict
  diff : list[DiffEntry]
  locals_diff : list[DiffEntry]
  iteration : optional dict
  completed_iteration : optional dict
  error : optional DebugError
  successful_index : int
}
class VrlExpression {
  index : int
  start_line : int
  end_line : int
  source : str
}
class BranchNode {
  expression : VrlExpression
  parent : optional Branch
  branches : list[Branch]
  loop : optional dict
}
class Branch {
  start : int
  end : int
  parent : BranchNode
  children : list[BranchNode]
}
class DiffEntry {
  path : str
  kind : added / changed / deleted
  old_value : JSON
  new_value : JSON
}
class RunResult {
  event : JSON
  locals : dict
  position : optional str
  iteration : optional dict
  completed_iteration : optional dict
  locals_warning : optional str
}
class TerminalUI {
  lines : original source lines
  auto_event : bool
  auto_locals : bool
  theme : Theme
}
class VectorRunner {
  binary : absolute path
  timeout : seconds
  run()
  run_checkpoints()
  condition()
}
TerminalUI --> DebugSession : commands / copied state
DebugSession *-- VrlExpression
DebugSession *-- DebugState : caches and history
DebugSession *-- BranchNode : parsed control roots
BranchNode *-- Branch
Branch *-- BranchNode : children
DebugState *-- DiffEntry
DebugSession --> VectorRunner : evaluation
VectorRunner ..> RunResult : returns
note bottom of DebugSession
current_state() returns a deep copy.
Replay starts from _input_event and applies recorded edits.
Restart retains caches, edits, watches and breakpoints.
Edit commit replaces evaluation caches and trace.
end note
@enduml
